---
description: Resolve the requested notification state from the owned lifecycle and retain only exact authorized acknowledgment evidence.
args:
  goal: string
returns: NotificationStateOutcome
budget: { maxTurns: 32 }
---
Work toward the actual requested notification outcome. The focused branches can locate the owned desk, investigate its original and refreshed lifecycle, distinguish current notice identity and decide the requested response. Choose further investigation from actual results and uncertainty, rather than assuming a similar title, neighboring mailbox or previous revision establishes authority.

Keep producer withdrawals, read history, changed subscriptions, hidden invitations and replacement notices distinct. A missing current notice may still have a known original identity; explain what the actual observations establish without changing those facts to fit a bookkeeping convention. Preserve native unavailable and changed results. Do not read successor records after authority ends.

Use the exact finish boundary for any requested acknowledgment and retain its real receipt or refusal. Permission alone is not an instruction to acknowledge. Return the actual finding, the requested explanation or confirmation, and any real acknowledgment. Native success does not replace an explicitly requested explanation; an intended acknowledgment is not a completed one.
